		<language name="English">Back in MY day, I was the hottest\nHustler in Cherrygrove. Ask anybody.\fThey dead now, but ask ’em.\rHere’s some old-head advice: recruit\na LOTTA homies!\rBut you can only roll six deep.\rThe rest go to the PC, and they can’t\nrun off from there.\rLike a timeshare.\rAnd remember what I’m ’bout to tell\nyou... Treat ’em ALL right. Unlike my\fbaby mamas did me.</language>
